{"text": "One dollar and eighty seven cents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That was all the money Della had, and sixty cents of it was in pennies. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had saved those pennies one or two at a time by bargaining with the grocer and the butcher. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Three times Della counted the money, and three times it was one dollar and eighty seven cents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the next day would be Christmas. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was clearly nothing to do but flop down on the shabby little couch and cry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So Della did it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Life, she thought, is made up of sobs, sniffles, and smiles, with sniffles in the lead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Della and her husband, Jim, lived in a small furnished flat that cost eight dollars a week. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Not long ago Jim had earned thirty dollars a week, but now his pay had fallen to twenty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Still, whenever Jim came home, Della ran to him and hugged him warmly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That was a happy thing to see.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "d", "o", "l", "l", "a", "r", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "e", "i", "g", "h", "t", "y", " ", "s", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "c", "e", "n", "t", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "n", "e", "y", " ", "D", "e", "l", "l", "a", " ", "h", "a", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "i", "x", "t", "y", " ", "c", "e", "n", "t", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "p", "e", "n", "n", "i", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "s", "a", "v", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "p", "e", "n", "n", "i", "e", "